### 6.3 File Management & Code Editor

#### File Upload
- `POST /api/repos/:id/upload` — multipart upload via Multer
- Files stored under `uploads/<repoId>/` on disk
- Metadata (name, path, size, type, repo_id, parent_folder_id, is_folder) stored in `files` table
- Supported types: all (generic uploads); chat uploads restricted to images (jpg, jpeg, png, gif, webp, max 10 MB)

#### File Tree
- Hierarchical folder/file structure via `parent_folder_id` self-reference
- `FileTreeSidebar` component renders the tree with expand/collapse
- Inline file creation and folder creation from the UI

#### Code Editor (Monaco)
- `CodeEditor` component wraps `@monaco-editor/react`
- Language auto-detected from file extension
- Supports syntax highlighting, line numbers, theme toggle (dark/light)
- Save triggers a commit entry recording the diff

#### Markdown Preview
- `MarkdownPreview` / `MarkdownPreviewComponent` — renders `.md` files via `react-markdown`
- Split-pane view: source on left, rendered preview on right

#### File Viewer
- `FileViewer` component for read-only display of binary/non-code files
- Image preview inline; other binary types show download link

#### Commit History
- `GET /api/repos/:id/commits` — paginated list of commits
- Each commit records: message, timestamp, author (user_id), affected file_id
- `CommitHistory` component shows timeline with author, message, and date

