### 6.4 Social Features

#### Follow / Unfollow
- `POST /api/users/:id/follow` — follow a user
- `DELETE /api/users/:id/follow` — unfollow
- `GET /api/users/:username/followers` — list followers
- `GET /api/users/:username/following` — list following
- Follow events recorded in `user_contributions` for the heatmap

#### Block
- `POST /api/users/block/:targetId` — block user (creates `blocked_users` record)
- `DELETE /api/users/block/:targetId` — unblock
- Blocked users cannot send messages or view certain profile data
- `Block` model manages `blocked_users` table

#### Contribution Heatmap
- GitHub-style contribution graph tracking daily activity
- Activities tracked: commit, upload, star, follow, issue_create, pr_create, message_send, badge_earned
- `GET /api/users/:username/contributions` — returns 365 days of daily counts
- `GET /api/users/:username/contributions/streak` — current and longest streak

#### Activity Feed
- `GET /api/activities` — paginated feed of the current user's activities
- `GET /api/users/:username/activities` — public activity for a profile
- Activity types: repo_created, file_uploaded, star_given, follow, badge_earned, comment, pr_opened, issue_opened, etc.

