### 6.9 AI Assistant & Code Intelligence

#### Chat Modes
| Mode | System Prompt Focus |
|------|-------------------|
| `chat` | General developer Q&A |
| `suggest` | Provide detailed code suggestions with markdown-formatted code blocks |
| `explain` | Explain code concepts, highlight potential issues |
| `improve` | Identify bugs, security issues, and optimization opportunities |

#### Backend
- `POST /api/ai/groq` — accepts `{ prompt, type }`
- Uses Groq SDK with model `llama-3.1-8b-instant`
- Temperature: 0.5, max tokens: 1000
- API key loaded from `process.env.GROQ_API_KEY`

#### Frontend
- `AIAssistant` component — chat interface with mode selector
- Renders AI responses with Prism.js syntax-highlighted code blocks
- Supports multi-turn conversation context

