### 6.10 Testing & QA Engine

#### AI-Powered Testing (`/api/testing`)

| Endpoint | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| `POST /api/testing/:repoId/analyze` | Full pipeline: static analysis + AI test plan + report |
| `POST /api/testing/:repoId/completeness` | Code completeness check only |
| `POST /api/testing/:repoId/static` | Static analysis only |
| `POST /api/testing/:repoId/test-plan` | AI-generated test plan |
| `POST /api/testing/:repoId/report` | AI-generated test report |
| `GET /api/testing/:repoId/status` | Latest job status |
| `GET /api/testing/:repoId/reports` | List saved reports |
| `GET /api/testing/languages` | Supported languages |

**Services involved:**
- `StaticAnalyzer` — linting-style checks, complexity metrics
- `CodeExtractor` — parses and extracts code from repository files
- `CacheService` — caches analysis results to avoid redundant processing
- `JobQueue` — async job processing with status tracking
- Groq AI — generates natural language test plans and reports

**Rate limiting:** 5 requests per user per minute (in-memory)

#### QA Dashboard (`/api/qa`, `/api/qa-advanced`)

| Concept | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `qa_reports` | Top-level report per repo run; stores `quality_score` and `status` |
