### 6.12 Gamification & Achievements

#### Badge Catalog
| Badge Key | Name | Trigger |
|-----------|------|---------|
| `first_repo` | First Repo 🚀 | Created first repository |
| `first_star` | First Star ⭐ | Received first star on any repo |
| `seven_day_streak` | 7 Day Streak 🔥 | Contributed 7 consecutive days |
| `power_contributor` | Power Contributor 💪 | 50+ total contributions |
| `first_pinned` | Pinned Repo 📌 | Pinned first repository |
| `verified` | Verified ✅ | Admin-granted verified status |

#### Badge Logic
- `BadgeService.awardBadge(userId, badgeKey)` — idempotent; awards once per user
- `BadgeService.checkAllBadges(userId)` — called after key events (repo create, follow, etc.)
- Badge award creates a `user_achievements` record and logs a `badge_earned` activity

#### Contribution Tracking
- Every meaningful action inserts a row into `user_contributions(user_id, activity_type, created_at)`
- Activity types: `commit`, `upload`, `star`, `follow`, `issue_create`, `pr_create`, `message_send`, `badge_earned`
- Socket broadcasts `new_contribution` event for live heatmap updates

