## 7. Database Schema

### Core Tables

```sql
users (
  id, username, email, password,
  name, bio, avatar_url, location, website, company,
  google_id, google_connected,
  github_access_token, github_login, github_connected,
  is_verified, last_seen,
  created_at, updated_at
)

repositories (
  id, name, description,
  visibility ENUM('public','private'),
  user_id FK,
  github_repo_url, github_linked,
  created_at, updated_at
)

files (
  id, name, path, size, type,
  repo_id FK,
  parent_folder_id FK(self),
  is_folder BOOLEAN,
  created_at, updated_at
)

commits (
  id, message, repo_id FK, user_id FK, file_id FK,
  created_at
)
```

### Social Tables

```sql
followers   (id, follower_id FK, following_id FK, created_at)
stars       (id, user_id FK, repo_id FK, created_at)
blocked_users (id, user_id FK, blocked_user_id FK, created_at)
```

### Collaboration Tables

```sql
